    "encrypted": "false",
    "display_name": "* Pyramid",
    "long_instructions": "# * Pyramid\r\n\r\nUse paragraph tags to create a sideways pyramid out of `*` symbols. Each line of the pyramid should be its own paragraph\r\n\r\n![Example * pyramid](https://images.code.org/527e7cf7e65abec17423990d3be565f0-Screenshot%202025-12-31%20170852.png)\r\n\r\n# Do This\r\n\r\n1) Recreate a pyramid out of `*` symbols that is 5 `*`'s long.\r\n\t- Be sure to use `<p>` and `</p>` tags so each line of the pyramid appears as a separate line\r\n    \r\n::: details [🔎 **Show Me How** 🔍]\r\n\r\n`<body>`\r\n\r\n`<p>` * `</p>`\r\n    \r\n`<p>` * * `</p>`\r\n    \r\n`<p>` * * * `</p>`\r\n\r\n_keep going!_\r\n\r\n**More resources are in the \"Help and Tips\" tab**\r\n:::",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Use paragraph tags to create a sideways pyramid out of * symbols.",
